Package: kiyonagalabviz
Type: Package
Title: Kiyonaga Lab Styled Publication-Ready Plots in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Vivien", "Chopurian", email = "vchopurian@ucsd.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A ggplot2 theme, colour palettes and plotting helpers that follow
    the visual style of the Kiyonaga Lab: colour schemes, font sizes, summary plots,
    fitted relationships, distributions, subject trajectories, and figure export
    with optional separate legends for manuscripts and slides, and authenticated
    refresh of plot panels in Google Slides.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/vsc04/kiyonagalabviz
BugReports: https://github.com/vsc04/kiyonagalabviz/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
